                575
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "称为n阶矩阵A的行列式，记成 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\left| A \\right|"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "或 detA."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                92,
                580,
                478,
                598
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "【注】矩阵A是一个表格，而行列式A是一个数，这里的概念与符号不要混淆. "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "A = \\boldsymbol{O}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "与 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\left| \\textbf{A} \\right| = 0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "是不同的，不能搞错.当 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "A \\ne 0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "时可能有 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\left| \\textbf{A} \\right| = 0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，当然也可能有 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| \\neq 0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ".这些基本常识要想清楚."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                92,
                604,
                684,
                669
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
