        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "定义（加法）两个同型矩阵(行数与列数分别相等）可以相加，且"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                132,
                722,
                677,
                739
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} = \\left[ a_{ij} \\right]_{m \\times n} + \\left[ b_{ij} \\right]_{m \\times n} = \\left[ a_{ij} + b_{ij} \\right]_{m \\times n}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/a7ebe09500099868585ad257d7c685403c79c640046fd6092eec09874ec28eba.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                189,
                744,
                578,
                762
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "定义（数量乘法，简称数乘）设k是数 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\boldsymbol{A} = \\left[ a_{ij} \\right]_{m \\times n}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "是矩阵，则定义数与矩阵的乘法为"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                92,
                768,
                680,
                807
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "k \\boldsymbol{A} = k \\left[ a_{ij} \\right]_{m \\times n} = \\left[ k a_{ij} \\right]_{m \\times n}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/0b7d47d0ee6cfe4893e271b7c4bfbffdf6ecd2e65b6f35e2960925a05c5dac98.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                262,
                813,
                509,
                832
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例如 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\begin{aligned}, \\boldsymbol{A} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 3 & - 2 \\\\ & & \\\\ 0 & - 4 & 5 \\end{bmatrix}, \\boldsymbol{B} = \\begin{bmatrix} 8 & 3 & 5 \\\\ & & \\\\ 1 & 2 & - 6 \\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ",则"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                131,
                837,
                561,
                875
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\boldsymbol{A} + \\boldsymbol{B} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 + 8 & 3 + 3 & - 2 + 5 \\\\ 0 + 1 & - 4 + 2 & 5 + ( - 6 ) \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 9 & 6 & 3 \\\\ 1 & - 2 & - 1 \\end{bmatrix},",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/d6c4d883b83d9a70ef427c56db5d5e6c541077b8e9904d73f186fed30c6cc954.jpg"
